<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 75.3850 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 75.3850 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.3850 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Thursday after 74.6900 on Wednesday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     Apr 17		  Apr 16</p>
<p> High			     75.3850		 75.0000</p>
<p> Low				74.5000		 74.6800</p>
<p> Open			     74.5000		 75.0000</p>
<p> Close			    75.3850		 74.6900</p>
<p> Volume ($ mln)		  2.350		   4.345</p>
<p> TENGE PER MARK		 Apr 17		  Apr 15</p>
<p> High			     44.0000		 44.5000</p>
<p> Low				43.9000		 43.8600</p>
<p> Open			     44.0000		 44.5000</p>
<p> Close			    43.9000		 43.8600</p>
<p> Volume (DM mln)		 0.190		   0.015</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
